{"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentSheet"],"anchor":"Getting-Started","title":"Getting Started"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the SDK, present a payment surface, and handle the result."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrating Mollie Components is three steps: add the package, present the sheet from your checkout screen with a server-issued client access token, and switch over the typed "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" you get back. Card data the cardholder types stays inside Mollie’s UI and is tokenized over TLS — your code only ever sees session metadata."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK requires iOS 16.0+, Swift 5.9+, and Xcode 16+. It is distributed exclusively via Swift Package Manager.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Add-the-package","text":"Add the package"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/mollie\/mollie-components-ios\", from: \"0.1.0\")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Or in Xcode: ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"File → Add Package Dependencies…","type":"text"}]},{"text":", then paste the repository URL.","typ